      "title": "Dumbbell One Arm Triceps Extension (on bench)",
      "url": "https://gymvisual.com/videos/5047-dumbbell-one-arm-triceps-extension-on-bench.html",
      "listing": "Video; data sheet: body part Upper Arms, equipment Dumbbell, exercise type Strength",
      "note": "Reference used only to identify the movement. No GymVisual media is stored here; this rig, model and animation are original."
    },
